From 899dfb171b6c0493f1448cb19ec49adbc158d746 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:12:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 474/474] feat(kanban): read-only origin ownership_snapshot for
 the abandonment guard [daveey]

Nonconsuming, query_only snapshot (owner gateway/profile/board/task + origin
request uid/digest): qualified binding generation, owner running-claim/PID or
wake proof, scoped return-consumer health with epoch/incarnation that advances
on Stop/replacement/disconnect/scope loss. Unknown without proof. Remote owners
answer via 'hermes kanban ownership-snapshot' over the existing hub courier.
---
